From 5cce3013be4d9acbb9edcb56e071bb3c17794ea0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:10:46 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] carriersettings: add ims call timers from samsung
 operator profiles

the pixel configs leave the ringing, ringback and session expiry
timers at the aosp defaults for most carriers, so calls ring out and
refresh sessions on timers the network does not expect.

take the values the samsung ims profiles set per operator and add
them only where the carrier config does not set the key itself and
the value differs from the effective default. the sip transaction
timers are left out, samsung pairs its short ones with a cs retry
that the ims stack here does not do.
